            "title": "國際｜歐股高收近1% 汽車股造好電訊股受壓",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜歐股高收近1% 汽車股造好電訊股受壓\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜歐股高收近1% 汽車股造好電訊股受壓</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">歐洲主要股市周五收市上升，升幅接近1%或以上。汽車股受歐盟與中國達成協議帶動造好，電訊股則因SpaceX收購頻譜交易受壓。德國DAX指數收報25087點，升1.1%；法國CAC指數升近1%；英國富時100指數升近1.1%。全星期計，德股及法股連跌兩周，英股錄得升幅。</p></div>",
