            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "農業機械股承壓，監管調查與農作物價格下跌形成雙重打擊",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"迪爾公司股價下挫，FTC與USDA聯手調查農業設備市場\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b6d9e43bf4fd5c792b3b49ad15c6a4007cc4bef5a52035165649a44e69897663/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA7E0LA_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">迪爾公司股價下挫，FTC與USDA聯手調查農業設備市場</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 主要農業機械製造商本週料將收低，該板塊同時面臨聯邦監管調查與農作物市場惡化的雙重衝擊。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">迪爾公司（NYSE: DE）週五下跌4%，本週累計跌幅擴大至9%。愛科集團（NYSE: AGCO）與凱斯紐荷蘭工業（NYSE: CNH）週五亦大幅下挫，各跌5%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">拋售壓力在美國農業部（USDA）上調玉米產量及產出預測後明顯加劇，導致玉米期貨急挫。大豆期貨亦因產量預估同樣遭上調而走低。農作物價格大幅下跌直接侵蝕農民收入，進而壓縮對拖拉機及收割機等資本密集型農業機械的需求。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-e0eb5c14-b64c-3d74-8dc8-f0a61d20387c-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">該板塊本週早些時候已遭受衝擊，起因是美國農業部與聯邦貿易委員會（FTC）宣布聯合調查農業設備市場的商業行為，重點針對潛在的反競爭行為。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">迪爾公司股價目前有望錄得自2024年8月以來最差的單週表現，監管審查與大宗商品價格持續下跌令投資者情緒承受沉重壓力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%BE%B2%E6%A5%AD%E6%A9%9F%E6%A2%B0%E8%82%A1%E6%89%BF%E5%A3%93-%E7%9B%A3%E7%AE%A1%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E8%88%87%E8%BE%B2%E4%BD%9C%E7%89%A9%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC%E4%B8%8B%E8%B7%8C%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E9%9B%99%E9%87%8D%E6%89%93%E6%93%8A-202845684.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-10 04:33:43",
